  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Organizations as Actors of Governance and Development in Jamaica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project aims to strengthen and focus the capacity of CSOs to participate in the&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;implementation and monitoring of public issues and policies within their communities and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;fulfil our role as an essential building block of development and national cohesion. Citizens&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;have a voice through CSOs to communicate with the government to assist in delivering&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;services and programmes and hold them accountable through watchdog organisations.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
